{"unit_id":"KaguraSayuki__dsh-file-download#caveat-1","repo":"KaguraSayuki/dsh-file-download","commit":"18b17fb73ad5d52187b0f5e12c41d21a45e91a20","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-download 使用前须知：二进制上传通过宿主本机文件系统写入，因此非本机执行世界的后端可能无法把文件写到预期位置（见 lib/index.js:1276-1284）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1276-1284"]}
